%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 24cee7e49fc532a45ab71bd5ace6cb7b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Stage3Pre
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Haah... I'm sure it was around here somewhere...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD558\uC544... \uBD84\uBA85 \uC5EC\uAE30 \uADFC\uCC98\uC600\uB294\uB370..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 67b5dd471d2fdea4eb0322b8c9ef0b5b, type: 3}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: How long am I supposed to just follow you around? The sun's already
      down.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B8\uC81C\uAE4C\uC9C0 \uADF8\uB0E5 \uB530\uB77C\uB2E4\uB140\uC57C
      \uD574\uC694? \uBC8C\uC368 \uD574\uAC00 \uC84C\uB294\uB370\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: And are you going to keep carrying that stick? What even are
      these dead weeds...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0 \uADF8\uAC70 \uACC4\uC18D \uB4E4\uACE0 \uC788\uC744
      \uAC70\uC608\uC694? \uBB50\uC57C \uC774 \uD480\uB5BC\uAE30\uB4E4\uC740..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Dried flower stalks. They used to bloom wherever the water ran.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB9C8\uB978 \uAF43\uB300\uC57C. \uC608\uC804\uC5D0 \uBB3C\uAE38
      \uC704\uC5D0 \uD53C\uC5C8\uB358 \uAC83\uB4E4\uC774\uC9C0."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: The way I remember it, there's a very good well around here.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB0B4\uAC00 \uAE30\uC5B5\uD558\uAE30\uB85C\uB294 \uC5EC\uAE30
      \uADFC\uCC98\uC5D0 \uC544\uC8FC \uC88B\uC740 \uC6B0\uBB3C\uC774 \uC788\uC5B4."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Once it bursts, it pours and pours for a long time.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uD130\uC9C0\uAE30\uB9CC \uD558\uBA74 \uC624\uB7AB\uB3D9\uC548
      \uBB3C\uC774 \uD391\uD391 \uC3DF\uC544\uC838 \uB098\uC624\uAC70\uB4E0."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: But it's just as hard to work as it is good, so...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADFC\uB370 \uADF8\uB9CC\uD07C \uC791\uC5C5\uD558\uAE30 \uC5B4\uB824\uC6B4
      \uACF3\uC774\uB77C\uC11C..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: So you've been leaving it alone ever since it stopped.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBA48\uCD98 \uB4A4\uB85C \uBC29\uCE58\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC5C8\uAD70\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: That's right... But today feels like the day to finally take
      it on.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uB9DE\uC544... \uADFC\uB370 \uC624\uB298\uC774 \uBC14\uB85C
      \uC190\uC744 \uB308 \uB0A0\uC778 \uAC83 \uAC19\uB124."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Getting you to start a chore you'd been putting off...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uBBF8\uB8E8\uB358 \uADC0\uCC2E\uC740 \uC77C\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD558\uAC8C
      \uD558\uB2E4\uB2C8"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Maybe this seed was really a present for you, Tessa?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC0AC\uC2E4 \uC774 \uC528\uC557\uC740 \uD14C\uC0AC\uB97C \uC704\uD55C
      \uC120\uBB3C\uC774 \uC544\uB2C8\uC5C8\uC744\uAE4C\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Thanks so much for the little nudge, really...
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC0AC\uC18C\uD55C \uACC4\uAE30\uB97C \uC918\uC11C \uACE0\uB9D9\uAD6C\uB9CC
      \uC815\uB9D0\uB85C..."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Oh! Isn't that it?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC5B4! \uC800\uAC70 \uC544\uB2C8\uC5D0\uC694?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Ah, good eye. That's the one.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC544, \uC798 \uCC3E\uC558\uC5B4. \uC800\uAC70 \uB9DE\uC544."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: Wow. That really doesn't look easy.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC6B0\uC640, \uC815\uB9D0\uB85C \uC27D\uC9C0 \uC54A\uC544 \uBCF4\uC774\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Still, if we pull it off, this whole area will have good water
      for a while.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB798\uB3C4 \uC131\uACF5\uD558\uACE0 \uB098\uBA74 \uC774
      \uADFC\uBC29\uC740 \uD55C\uB3D9\uC548 \uC88B\uC740 \uC218\uC6D0\uC774 \uB420
      \uAC70\uC57C."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Piper
    dialogueTextEN: I'm having some trouble picturing it.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD30C\uC774\uD37C"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC0C1\uC0C1\uC774 \uC798 \uC548 \uB418\uAE34 \uD558\uB124\uC694."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c68e10ce9d108aa4f9a55192ef845f07, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: This time you can actually get your hopes up.
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uC774\uBC88\uC5D0\uB294 \uAE30\uB300\uD574\uB3C4 \uC88B\uC544."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
  - hasDialogue: 1
    speakerNameEN: Tessa
    dialogueTextEN: Shall we get started?
    speakerNameKR: "\uD14C\uC0AC"
    dialogueTextKR: "\uADF8\uB7FC \uC2DC\uC791\uD574\uBCFC\uAE4C?"
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b9d7a8ed92ac80342a2e1a95edda6422, type: 3}
    changeBackground: 0
    background: {fileID: 0}
    changeBgm: 0
    bgm: {fileID: 0}
